    <string name="guide_title">HyperOS 3.0.309.0 Anti-Kill Steps</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_title">Step 1: Enable Autostart</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_desc">Go to Settings → Apps → Manage apps → HyperOS Battery → Enable Autostart (or Background autostart).</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_title">Step 2: Set Battery Saver to No Restrictions</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_desc">In App Info → Battery saver → Select \'No restrictions\' so HyperOS PowerKeeper never freezes charging monitoring.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_title">Step 3: Lock App in Recents</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_desc">Open Recents (swipe up &amp; hold) → Long-press this app card → Tap the Padlock icon to protect it from RAM cleanup.</string>
    <string name="guide_step4_title">Step 4: Disable Clear Cache When Locked</string>
    <string name="guide_step4_desc">Open Xiaomi Security app → Settings (top right) → Boost speed → \'Clear cache when device is locked\' → Never.</string>
    <string name="guide_step5_title">Step 5: Keep Monitor Notification Active</string>
    <string name="guide_step5_desc">Keep the ongoing monitor notification active (mute the \'Battery &amp; HyperOS Monitor\' channel instead of revoking notification permission).</string>
    <string name="btn_open_app_info">Open App Info for Steps 1 &amp; 2</string>

